et project-level system prompt → generate within project context", "Upload file or image → reference in prompt → AI analyses and responds", "Use prompt template → customise variables → send → save output", "Share conversation or output → recipient views without account"], "secondary_flows": ["All MVP secondary flows", "Create and save custom template", "Set up custom persona or assistant", "Export conversation as PDF or markdown", "Browse public template library"], "screens": [{"id": "home", "name": "Home / New Chat", "purpose": "Personalised home with projects, recent, and prompt suggestions", "visual": "Recent conversations. Projects row. Prompt suggestions by use case. New chat CTA.", "entities": ["Conversation", "Message", "Model", "Project"], "actions": ["All MVP actions", "View projects", "Start conversation in project", "View prompt suggestions by category"]}, {"id": "conversation", "name": "Conversation / Chat", "purpose": "Rich conversation with file uploads, image generation, and branching", "visual": "Thread. File attachment previews. Image generations inline. Branch conversation option.", "entities": ["Conversation", "Message", "Generation", "Feedback"], "actions": ["All MVP actions", "Upload file", "Upload image", "Generate image from prompt", "Branch conversation", "Save output"]}, {"id": "projects", "name": "Projects", "purpose": "Organise conversations into projects with shared context", "visual": "Project cards. Conversation count. System prompt indicator. Create project CTA.", "entities": ["Project", "Conversation", "User"], "actions": ["View all projects", "Create project", "Open project", "Set project system prompt", "Delete project"]}, {"id": "project_detail", "name": "Project Detail", "purpose": "Project conversations and shared context settings", "visual": "Project header. System prompt visible. Conversation list. New chat in project.", "entities": ["Project", "Conversation"], "actions": ["View project conversations", "New conversation in proj