 "Manage external access — accountant, auditor"]}, {"id": "alert_rules", "name": "Alerts & Rules", "purpose": "Advanced alert rules — fraud, compliance, cash thresholds", "visual": "Rule list. Rule type — fraud, budget, cash, compliance. Severity. Action.", "entities": ["Alert", "Transaction", "Account"], "actions": ["Create alert rule", "Set rule conditions", "Set severity", "Set action — notify, block, escalate", "View rule trigger history"]}, {"id": "custom_fields", "name": "Custom Fields & Chart of Accounts", "purpose": "Custom transaction fields and chart of accounts management", "visual": "COA tree structure. Custom field list. Create field. Map to COA.", "entities": ["Transaction", "Organisation"], "actions": ["View chart of accounts", "Add account code", "Create custom transaction field", "Map field to COA", "Import COA"]}, {"id": "net_worth", "name": "Financial Position", "purpose": "Consolidated financial position across all entities", "visual": "Consolidated assets vs liabilities. Per-entity breakdown. Trend. Export.", "entities": ["Account", "Metric"], "actions": ["All Startup actions", "View per-entity breakdown", "View consolidated", "Export position report"]}, {"id": "subscription", "name": "Subscription & Plan", "purpose": "Enterprise plan, seats, and billing management", "visual": "Enterprise plan card. Seat usage. Feature limits. Billing contact. Invoices.", "entities": ["Subscription", "Organisation"], "actions": ["View plan details", "Manage seats", "Update billing contact", "Download invoices", "Contact enterprise sales"]}, {"id": "sso_security", "name": "SSO & Security", "purpose": "Enterprise SSO, MFA enforcement, and session policy", "visual": "SSO config. MFA toggle. Session policy. IP restrictions. Active sessions.", "entities": ["User"], "actions": ["Configure SSO", "Enforce MFA", "Set session timeout", "IP allowlist", "View active sessions"]}, {"id": "settings", "name": "Settings", "purpose": "Enterprise settings — entities, compliance, integrations, security", "visual": "Settings sidebar. Entity management. Compliance. Integrations. SSO. Audit.", "entities": ["User", "Organisation", "Subscription"], "actions": ["All Startup actions", "Entity settings", "Compliance settings", "ERP integration settings", "Audit log settings"]}, {"id": "help_centre", "name": "Help Centre", "purpose": "Financial platform help with compliance and integration guidance", "visual": "Search. Categories — getting started, compliance, integrations, reporting. Contact.", "entities": ["User"], "actions": ["Search articles", "Browse compliance guides", "Browse integration docs", "Contact enterprise support"]}], "interaction_patterns": ["All MVP and Startup interaction patterns", "Entity switcher — dropdown at top of nav — switches all data context", "Approval chain visual — step bubbles — completed green, pending amber, rejected red", "Expense policy badge — compliant green, violation red — appears on expense card", "Reconciliation matched pair — connecting line between matched rows", "Audit log rows — immutable lock icon — cannot be deleted or edited", "P&L toggle — actuals vs budget vs forecast — tabs on report", "Cash flow scenario model — adjust assumption sliders — chart updates live", "Bulk approve — checkbox select expenses — single approve action"]}}, "icon_pack": {"default_library": {"name": "Material Symbols", "variant": "Outlined", "url": "https://fonts.google.com/icons"}, "industry_overrides": {"Finance": {"name": "Material Symbols", "variant": "Sharp", "url": "https://fonts.google.com/icons"}, "Healthcare": {"name": "Material Symbols", "variant": "Rounded", "url": "https://fonts.google.com/icons"}, "Transport & Logistics": {"name": "Material Symbols", "variant": "Sharp", "url": "https://fonts.google.com/icons"}, "Developer Tools": {"name": "Material Symbols", "variant": "Sharp", "url": "https://fonts.google.com/icons"}}, "core_nav_icons": ["home", "bar_chart", "group", "description", "person", "notifications", "sett